I have my first ascension, FINALLY!!!
I always thought my first would be a Valkyire, but recently I started
playing random characters and this is what I got!

I would like to dedicate this ascension to Fido II, my pet L20
Vampire-Lord, whom I lost on the way back up to the top of the dungeon
with the Amulet. He was with me for most of the game, he started out as
Titan, but he polymorphed to something else(Brown Pudding?) so then I
zapped him into a Vampire-Lord.
Also, a big thanks to all the posters on this group and for all their
wisdom...

It was a pretty lucky kind of game, no real serious worries where I
tought I was really going to die. I found a total of 5 magic markers, 3
in a large tool shop, which really made things MUCH easier. I didn't
find any bones, I used 7 wishes, mainly for armour and some scrolls of
genocide(which I never found in the game). I was very lucky and went to
the correct altar first time on the Astral plane and only had to go up
against Pestillence once(Phew!!!) and managed to survive without dying
once!

